    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abarubeni n'Abagadi bashaka guhabwa gakondo hakuno ya Yorodani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarubeni n'Abagadi bari bafite amatungo menshi cyane. Babonye igihugu cy'i Yazeri n'icy'i Galeyadi ko bifite urwuri rwiza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagadi n'Abarubeni baragenda babwira Mose na Eleyazari umutambyi n'abatware b'iteraniro, bati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ataroti n'i Diboni n'i Yazeri, n'i Nimura n'i Heshiboni na Eleyale, n'i Sibuma n'i Nebo n'i Bewoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "igihugu Uwiteka yatsindishije iteraniro ry'Abisirayeli, ni igihugu cy'urwuri kandi abagaragu bawe dufite amatungo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bati “Niba tukugiriyeho umugisha, abagaragu bawe duhabwe icyo gihugu ho gakondo, ntutwambutse Yorodani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose abaza Abagadi n'Abarubeni ati “Bene wanyu bazatabara mwiyicariye ino? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni iki gitumye mukura umutima w'Abisirayeli mugatuma badashaka kwambuka ngo bajye mu gihugu Uwiteka yabahaye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.13.17+NUM.13.18+NUM.13.19+NUM.13.20+NUM.13.21+NUM.13.22+NUM.13.23+NUM.13.24+NUM.13.25+NUM.13.26+NUM.13.27+NUM.13.28+NUM.13.29+NUM.13.30+NUM.13.31+NUM.13.32+NUM.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 13.17-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Uko ni ko ba so bagenjeje, ubwo nabatumaga gutata icyo gihugu, ndi i Kadeshi Baruneya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamaze kuzamuka bakajya mu gikombe cya Eshikoli bakareba icyo gihugu, bakura umutima w'Abisirayeli ngo batajya mu gihugu Uwiteka yabahaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.26+NUM.14.27+NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 14.26-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Uburakari bw'Uwiteka bukongezwa kuri uwo munsi, ararahira ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ni ukuri ntihazagira uwo mu bagabo bavuye muri Egiputa, bamaze imyaka makumyabiri bavutse cyangwa isāga, uzabona igihugu narahiye Aburahamu na Isaka na Yakobo ko nzakibaha, kuko badakurikira uko mbayobora muri byose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "keretse Kalebu mwene Yefune Umukenazi na Yosuwa mwene Nuni, kuko bo bakurikira uko Uwiteka abayobora muri byose.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bīkongereza uburakari bw'Uwiteka, abazerereza hirya no hino mu butayu imyaka mirongo ine, kugeza aho ab'icyo gihe bose bakoze ibyo Uwiteka abona ko ari bibi, barimbukiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwe none musubiye mu kigwi cya ba so, muri urubyaro rw'abanyabyaha ngo mugwize umujinya w'Uwiteka mutume urushaho kugurumanira Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimucyamika ntimukurikire uko abayobora, azongera areke Abisirayeli mu butayu, namwe muzarimbuze ubu bwoko bwose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamwigira hafi baramubwira bati “Tuzubakira imikumbi yacu ibiraro, n'abana bacu bato tuzabubakira imidugudu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ariko twe ubwacu twihute kwitegurira intwaro ngo tujye Abisirayeli imbere, tugeze aho tuzamarira kubageza ahabo. Kandi abana bacu bato bazabe bari mu midugudu igoteshejwe inkike z'amabuye, ngo barindwe bene igihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntituzagaruka mu ngo zacu, umuntu wese wo mu Bisirayeli atarahabwa gakondo ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntituzagira gakondo muri bo hakurya ya Yorodani cyangwa hirya yaho, kuko gakondo yacu tuyihawe hakuno ya Yorodani mu ruhande rw'iburasirazuba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose arabasubiza ati “Nimubigenza mutyo, mukitegura intwaro zanyu ngo mujye Uwiteka imbere mutabare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abagabo bose bo muri mwe bafite intwaro bakambuka Yorodani bagiye Uwiteka imbere, mukageza aho azirukanira ababisha be bamuri imbere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "igihugu kigatsindirwa imbere y'Uwiteka. Muzabona kugaruka mwe kugibwaho n'urubanza rw'uko mucumuye ku Uwiteka cyangwa ku Bisirayeli, kandi iki gihugu kizababera gakondo imbere y'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko nimutagenza mutyo muzaba mucumuye ku Uwiteka, kandi mumenye neza yuko icyaha cyanyu kizabatoteza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwubakire abana banyu bato imidugudu, n'imikumbi yanyu ibiraro, mukore ibyo muvuze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagadi n'Abarubeni babwira Mose bati “Abagaragu bawe tuzabigenza uko databuja ategetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana bacu bato n'abagore bacu, n'imikumbi yacu n'amatungo yacu yose, bizaguma mu midugudu y'i Galeyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko twe abagaragu bawe tuzambuka uko tungana, abagabo bose bafite intwaro z'intambara, tujye Uwiteka imbere dutabare, nk'uko databuja avuze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
